yNote:["历史失败不自动视为当前故障；最新执行结果单独判断。","Historical failures are not automatically current incidents. Latest execution outcomes are assessed separately."],sumLatestFailed:["最近一次保护任务异常","Latest protection execution needs attention"],sumDependencyRisk:["配置或组件需检查","Dependency needs attention"],sumNotChecked:["尚未检查或上报状态","Not validated / reported"],sumSeverity:["级别","Severity"],sumAffected:["关联对象","Associated objects"],sumAssociationNote:["关联关系不代表故障原因；未知状态不算作已确认故障。","Association does not establish causation. Unknown is not a confirmed failure."],sumDependencies:["关联配置与基础设施","Configuration and infrastructure"],sumRepository:["存储仓库","Repository"],sumProxy:["源端代理","Source Proxy"],sumGateway:["存储网关","Storage gateway"],sumRecoveryTarget:["恢复目标","Recovery target"],sumSourceCluster:["源集群","Source cluster"],sumRole:["组件 / 配置类型","Component / configuration type"],sumLastChecked:["最近校验 / 上报","Last validated / reported"],sumCapacity:["样例占用 / 容量","Sample usage / capacity"],sumScope:["当前配置保护范围","Configured protection scope"],sumScopeNote:["仅展示已配置路径或资源范围，不推断全部业务覆盖；未提供的排除规则显示“—”。","Shows configured paths or resources, not inferred full-business coverage. Missing exclusion rules show —."],sumPolicyTarget:["时效策略","Freshness policy"],sumPolicyNote:["BDR 按配置 RPO；文件和容器备份按计划时效。手动、暂停和未知不计为超期。","BDR uses configured RPO; file and container backups use schedule freshness. Manual, paused and unknown are not overdue."],sumProtectionObjects:["保护对象状态","Protection object status"],sumSearch:["搜索对象、路径或目标","Search objects, paths or targets"],sumSearchConfig:["搜索配置、组件或关联对象","Search configuration, component or associated object"],sumAll:["全部","All"],sumFilterGaps:["未配置保护或配置缺少恢复点","Not configured or configuration missing a recovery point"],sumFilterFreshness:["恢复点未及时更新","Recovery point not updated in time"],sumFilterActive:["执行中","Active"],sumFilterVerification:["恢复可用性需确认","Recovery readiness needs confirmation"],sumDetails:["查看详情","View details"],sumOpenProfessional:["进入专业页面处理","Handle in product workbench"],s